<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="筛选" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="TabsFilter">TabsFilter</desc><desc>和标签页组件类似，不同的是筛选栏组件只用于筛选。</desc><desc>支持 Tabs 项左对齐、宽度均分</desc><desc>支持自定义文本色、背景色</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">数据项</title><desc type="prop" text="options[x].text">options[x].text</desc><desc type="value" text="Tab项名称">Tab项名称</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].value">options[x].value</desc><desc type="value" text="Tab项值">Tab项值</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].iconName">options[x].iconName</desc><desc type="value" text="图标名称">图标名称</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].iconColor">options[x].iconColor</desc><desc type="value" text="图标颜色">图标颜色</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].iconSelectColor">options[x].iconSelectColor</desc><desc type="value" text="选中时图标颜色">选中时图标颜色</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].iconUrl">options[x].iconUrl</desc><desc type="value" text="自定义图片">自定义图片</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].iconSelectUrl">options[x].iconSelectUrl</desc><desc type="value" text="选中时自定义图片">选中时自定义图片</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].iconSize">options[x].iconSize</desc><desc type="value" text="图标大小">图标大小</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" bind:tabs_filter_tap="handleClick" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指定选中项</title><desc type="prop" text="current">current</desc><desc type="value" text="从0开始">从0开始</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" current="1" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">主题</title><desc>深色主题</desc><desc type="prop" text='theme="durk"'>theme="durk"</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" theme="durk" /><line /><desc>浅色主题</desc><desc type="prop" text='theme="light"'>theme="light"</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" theme="light" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">左对齐</title><desc type="prop" text="isLeft">isLeft</desc><desc type="value" text="深色主题">深色主题</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" theme="durk" isLeft /><line /><desc>浅色主题</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" theme="light" isLeft /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">选项超出</title><desc>深色主题</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options2}}" theme="durk" /><line /><desc>浅色主题</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options2}}" theme="light" average /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">自定义文本色</title><desc type="prop" text="textColor">textColor</desc><desc type="prop" text="textCurrentColor">textCurrentColor</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" textColor="#999" textCurrentColor="#0cb798" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">自定义选中项背景色</title><desc type="prop" text="currentColor">currentColor</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" currentColor="#1677FF" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">文本字号</title><desc type="prop" text="textSize">textSize</desc><desc type="value" text="默认：28，不带单位">默认：28，不带单位</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" textSize="32" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">Bar自定义背景色</title><desc type="prop" text="bgColor">bgColor</desc><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options}}" bgColor="#e4b856" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">带图标</title><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options3}}" /><mx-tabs-filter options="{{options3}}" current="1" /></wrap><line /><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view>